   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Does anyone know of a good way to get query data from the <a href=\"http://www.tase.co.il/Heb/General/Company/Pages/companyHistoryData.aspx?subDataType=0&amp;companyID=000604&amp;shareID=00604611\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.tase.co.il/Heb/General/Company/Pages/companyHistoryData.aspx?subDataType%3D0%26companyID%3D000604%26shareID%3D00604611&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497552098000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cDYRxROx8VNhv87NPAuTW\">TASE website</a>? something like below, but connecting to the tase website. right now one can only download one csv at a time and the query to get to the csv is js based so it cant be written into the url like in yahoo or google finance sites.<div><br></div><div>thanks </div><div><br></div><div>Yoni<br><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128)\">#load packages</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nlibrary</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">stockPortfolio</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nlibrary</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">quadprog</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128)\">#get data of returns</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nstocks </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;SPY&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;EFA&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;IWM&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;VWO&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;LQD&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;HYG&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nreturns </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> getReturns</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">stocks</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> freq</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;week&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span></code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:inherit\">returns</span></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font